        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Max Cavalera, Billy Idol, Gwen Stefani, Tony Kanal, Roberta Flack\n- Roles: singers, guitarists, songwriters, actor, musicians\n- Bands: Soulfly, Cavalera Conspiracy, Killer Be Killed\n- Songs and Albums: \"4 in the Morning\"\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Idol, born William Michael Albert Broad on 30 November 1955, is an English musician, singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Max Cavalera, born Massimiliano Antonio Cavalera on August 4, 1969, is a Brazilian singer, guitarist, and songwriter.\n- Max Cavalera currently plays in the heavy metal bands Soulfly, Cavalera Conspiracy, and Killer Be Killed.\n- Gwen Stefani described \"4 in the Morning\" as one of her favorite songs on its album.\n- Gwen Stefani began writing \"4 in the Morning\" while pregnant and later finished it with Tony Kanal.\n- Gwen Stefani drew inspiration from Roberta Flack and Billy Idol when writing \"4 in the Morning\".",
